


/*Two friends, Alice and Bob, start walking from point 0
 on a long straight road.

Alice makes a step of length a
 meters.
Bob makes a step of length b
 meters.
They both start at the same time and walk in the same direction. You need to find the first position (in meters) where both of them will land on the same spot again (other than the starting point).

Input
The first line contains t
 (1≤t≤105)
 — the number of test cases.

Each of the next n
 lines contains two integers a
 and b
 (1≤a,b≤109)
 — Alice's step size and Bob's step size respectively.

Output
For each test case, print the first position where both of them land together again.*/